{"id":342,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"課題解決と体験を通して学ぶ世田谷附属","feature_description":"世田谷附属では、基礎・基本の知識技能を確実に身につけたうえで、それを活用する応用的・発展的な学習を行います。課題解決的・体験的な学習を通じて、考える力、考えを表現する力、コミュニケーションする力を育成。生活指導では自他を尊重し、集団の一員として奉仕活動に取り組む姿勢を重視します。進路指導では個性や能力を理解し、主体的に選択する力を育てています。","clubs":[{"id":6064,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sechu.u-gakugei.ac.jp/modules/ictea_base/include/js/ckeditor/kcfinder/upload/files/20260525141758.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6065,"name":"野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sechu.u-gakugei.ac.jp/modules/ictea_base/include/js/ckeditor/kcfinder/upload/files/20260525141758.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6066,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sechu.u-gakugei.ac.jp/modules/ictea_base/include/js/ckeditor/kcfinder/upload/files/20260525141758.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6067,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sechu.u-gakugei.ac.jp/modules/ictea_base/include/js/ckeditor/kcfinder/upload/files/20260525141758.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6068,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sechu.u-gakugei.ac.jp/modules/ictea_base/include/js/ckeditor/kcfinder/upload/files/20260525141758.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6069,"name":"陸上","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sechu.u-gakugei.ac.jp/modules/ictea_base/include/js/ckeditor/kcfinder/upload/files/20260525141758.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6070,"name":"硬式テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sechu.u-gakugei.ac.jp/modules/ictea_base/include/js/ckeditor/kcfinder/upload/files/20260525141758.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6071,"name":"ブラスバンド","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sechu.u-gakugei.ac.jp/modules/ictea_base/include/js/ckeditor/kcfinder/upload/files/20260525141758.pdf","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":6072,"name":"イラスト絵画文芸","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://sechu.u-gakugei.ac.jp/modules/ictea_base/include/js/